# SecureText update-signing public key (Ed25519, base64), pinned into the
# desktop app at build time. Only releases whose manifest is signed by the
# matching private key are ever installed. The private key is kept offline
# (docs/releasing.md); it never touches GitHub.
#
# Rotating: add the new key as another line, ship one release signed with
# the old key that pins both, then sign with the new one.
